==Notes==
*When Mallyx is defeated, two sets of four Margonites and torment creatures will spawn.
*The [[Citadel Chest]] and a [[Spirit of Truth]] spawn after Mallyx is defeated.
*There is a unique [[Miniature Mallyx|miniature version]] of Mallyx.
*See [[The Ebony Citadel of Mallyx]] for a walkthrough of how to defeat Mallyx.
*Oddly enough, in [[Hard Mode]], this creature is of a higher level (33) than [[Abaddon|the god he used to serve]] (32).

